{\pard\sa180\sb300\b\fs28 7. Definition of done for each feature\par}
\par
{\pard\sa80\fs20 - Reachable by user through actual application UI or explicitly permitted agent command.\par}
{\pard\sa80\fs20 - Operates on real media, not mocked success.\par}
{\pard\sa80\fs20 - Correct in timeline and preview, survives save/reload when applicable, undoable when appropriate.\par}
{\pard\sa80\fs20 - Export contains the actual requested modification.\par}
{\pard\sa80\fs20 - Regression tests include failure cases; browser tests for user flows.\par}
