{\pard\sa80\fs20 | **OpenReel** | https://github.com/Augani/openreel-video | Existing React/TS/Zustand editor workspace with web, Electron desktop, core, agent, WebCodecs/media backend; imported at SHA 367d7e90b61b5181f9861b852bb8b9d7a7d2954a | **Retain production foundation for now**; protects tested browser edited MP4 and migration budget | Full visual/audio parity, gesture tests, Windows runtime, GPU/4K, licenses |\par}
