{\pard\sa180\sb300\b\fs28 Compatibility and integration guide\par}
\par
{\pard\sa80\fs20 **Good low-risk candidate:** isolated pure algorithm, waveform component, subtitle parser, frame comparison, image/audio processing behind a typed interface; tests demonstrate no breaking timing semantics.\par}
\par
{\pard\sa80\fs20 **Medium-risk:** FFmpeg native adapter, isolated transcoding/proxy process, color transform layer, on-device transcription with worker isolation; requires performance, security and licensing review.\par}
\par
{\pard\sa80\fs20 **High-risk / NOT TO MERGE:** FreeCut's custom playback Clock, timeline/composition runtime, history/state, project/workspace file layout, codecs and canvas renderer; OpenCut's future Rust core and editor schema; entire alternative web apps; competing video renderer and project persistence. Migration requires an ADR with measurable import/edit/export proof and rollback plan.\par}
